sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Controller
  participant W as Worker
  participant H as Gated helper
  C->>W: Request token, target, epoch, deadline
  W-->>C: Creation intent
  alt Explicit fork failure
    W-->>C: Timely fork errno, no helper created
    C->>C: Failed observation, no helper residual
  else Helper created
    W->>H: Fork behind exec gate
    W-->>C: Publish PID, parent, PGID, request token
    alt Publication complete and before deadline
      W->>H: Release gate without controller ACK
      H->>H: Check token and expiry, close gate, exec ps
      C->>C: Record helper ownership in memory
      Note over C,H: Receipt processing need not precede exec
      H-->>W: Bounded bytes and exit
      W-->>C: Terminal result and helper reap evidence
      C->>C: Validate epoch, identity and deadline
    else Publication fails or expires
      W->>H: Gate stays closed, account for owned helper
      C->>C: Fail request, retain any published identity
    end
  else No outcome at deadline or observed worker exit
    C->>C: Sticky failure, unknown creation attempt
  end
  opt Failed request
    C->>W: Retire worker, signal only pinned worker group
    C->>C: Continue workload safety and resource teardown
    Note over W,H: Late identity refines residuals only, expired query cannot pass
  end
